WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,430 --> 00:00:02,430
It’s time to deal with fruits and vegetables

2
00:00:02,430 --> 00:00:12,570
I will always go out and live with other people in the future

3
00:00:12,570 --> 00:00:14,820
Steam until food is scarce

4
00:00:14,820 --> 00:00:16,820
You can't take out freshly picked cabbage in front of others

5
00:00:16,820 --> 00:00:19,820
Wrapping dried vegetables makes it easier to cover them up

6
00:00:19,820 --> 00:00:34,140
The favor from last time has not been repaid yet

7
00:00:34,140 --> 00:00:35,140
What else are you giving?

8
00:00:35,140 --> 00:00:37,140
Newly cultivated vegetable seedlings

9
00:00:37,140 --> 00:00:39,740
Take it and try it

10
00:00:39,740 --> 00:00:40,740
Connotation vegetables

11
00:00:40,740 --> 00:00:42,740
None of the shorts today

12
00:00:42,740 --> 00:00:44,740
The number newly cultivated by scientific research institutes is small

13
00:00:44,740 --> 00:00:45,740
The survival rate is not high either

14
00:00:45,740 --> 00:00:46,740
Not officially released yet

15
00:00:46,740 --> 00:00:48,940
I thought you might be able to use it

16
00:00:48,940 --> 00:00:52,500
I took some thanks

17
00:00:52,500 --> 00:00:53,500
Do you insist on paying it back?

18
00:00:53,500 --> 00:00:54,500
Must return

19
00:00:54,500 --> 00:00:58,180
I still don’t know what your name is.

20
00:00:58,180 --> 00:01:00,180
I call it God Bowl

21
00:01:00,180 --> 00:01:01,180
I remember
